# Postfix modifiers chain: the compiler loops expression suffixes
# (`str_size += 1 if a if b` in string/formatter.cr). The nested modifier is
# a child of the first, so single-modifier shapes are unchanged.
str_size += 1 if small_gap if e_index
total = compute(x) if ready unless skip
puts value if present if verbose
result = check rescue fallback rescue fatal
